00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:06.460
I really hate that so many predictions have
come true this week because of what it means

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:09.299
about the state of our democracy.

00:00:09.299 --> 00:00:13.860
Before there was any victory to claim this
week, Donald Trump said at two a.m. on Friday.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.460
On Tuesday night, early Wednesday morning
that he won the election.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:24.450
Then he started with the claims that it was
rigged about votes being found, all claims

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.769
which were flagged by Twitter as potentially
misleading about an election.

00:00:27.769 --> 00:00:30.120
And now Donald Trump is starting with lawsuits.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.150
The vote count resumed in Pennsylvania yesterday.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:36.460
And as this was happening, Donald Trump's
personal lawyer, Rudy Giuliani, and Donald

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:42.090
Trump's one of Donald Trump's sons, Eric Trump,
went to Philadelphia to announce major action

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:48.940
to stop the terrible cheating and vote counting
that was going on at the time.

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:55.870
It is not lost on me that in some cases Donald
Trump was saying we must stop counting votes

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:57.010
in other places.

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:02.880
Donald Trump was saying we must continue counting
votes and so were his supporters and will

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.449
get to some of that video.

00:01:04.449 --> 00:01:07.820
But first, Rudy Giuliani's explanation is
complete and total incoherence, saying that

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:13.350
he will file two lawsuits and a federal lawsuit
and maybe a national lawsuit.

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:17.510
I can't even get through this with a straight
face.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.910
Take a look at this and say that insanity.

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:25.110
And I challenge you to tell me what on earth
is Rudy talking about?

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:28.750
A hundred thousand fraudulent, meaningless
paper ballots that no one gets to observe.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.992
So we are going to continue the lawsuit here.

00:01:30.992 --> 00:01:40.240
We're going to bring a second one and then
we're going to bring a federal lawsuit and

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:47.150
we're going to take a very good look at whether
we bring this nationally.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.619
We certainly are going to bring it here.

00:01:49.619 --> 00:01:57.729
And in Wisconsin, quite possibly, we'll do
a national lawsuit and really expose the corruption

00:01:57.729 --> 00:01:58.780
of the Democrat Party.

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:02.220
But this is beyond anything I've ever seen
before.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:08.240
This comes when you think you have so much
power and you own the media that you can do

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:09.270
anything you want.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:12.490
Well, sorry, we're going to fight for the
people.

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:15.190
We're going to vindicate their right.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:19.940
And the ultimate result is President Trump
has won Pennsylvania.

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:21.570
He's going to vindicate people.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:22.880
He's filing for lawsuits.

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.500
This is maybe Rudy Giuliani's most humiliating
moment.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:30.260
And I've seen the Borat scene for people to
be to understand.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:32.230
